  "orchestratorToolAllow": {
    "$comment": "An orchestrator tool is offered only if it passes BOTH orchestrator.tools (empty = every tool) AND the inline exons definition's tools.allow (absent = no narrowing). The lifecycle tools, and the signal tools when enable_signals is on (the default), are exempt from tools.allow. Reference: validateOrchestratorToolAllowWithholds (v2.760.0).",
